{"kind": "mod", "id": 2444, "name": "Half-Life HEV Suit", "slug": "half-life-hev-suit", "teaser": "This aims to bring the HEV suit from Half-Life to Tarkov.", "owner_name": "Landonk89", "downloads": 1673, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "The Unlicense", "guid": "com.landonk89.hevsuitmod", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Equipment", "category_id": 15, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:01:17.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:28:35.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-11-13T19:27:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.3", "latest_version": "0.1.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/unlicense/", "description_html": "<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"MZgB-auivGY\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/MZgB-auivGY?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MZgB-auivGY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p>This is an early ALPHA version of the mod, I plan to continue working on it as long as I’m able but progress may be slow.</p>\n<p>Working right now:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hud mostly works (suit counter uses tactical vest slot, tested with strandhogg).</li>\n<li>Taking damage will display the direction it came from and type (like bullets, barbed wire, fire, etc etc)</li>\n<li>Major injuries will play a voiceline and automatically inject a relevant stim like morphine (doesn’t need to be on your pmc)</li>\n<li>A crosshair shows where your bullets will hit in the world and highlight red when over a player/bot</li>\n<li>Flashlight, toggled with ‘J’ by default (configurable in settings)</li>\n<li>Picking up items in the world will display a notification icon on the right side</li>\n<li>Weapon selection will show an icon and ammo level of the weapon at the top</li>\n</ul>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.3"